/* User Info: look the person's avatar, banner and bio up again now */
"Rescan Profile" = "Volver a escanear perfil";
"Profile rescanned." = "Perfil escaneado de nuevo.";

/* Chat payment From a spending address while the chatting address is empty (%@ = contact name) */
"Your chatting address has no KAS to tell %@ about this payment, so they see it as a payment from an unknown address, without the memo. KaChat tells them once your chatting address has some KAS." = "Tu dirección de chat no tiene KAS para avisar a %@ de este pago, así que lo verá como un pago de una dirección desconocida, sin la nota. KaChat le avisará cuando tu dirección de chat tenga algo de KAS.";

